\). If I multiply 3.2 and 18, I get 57.6. And then if I divide that by 0.224, I get 257.14. And if I round 3.24 to 3.3 and 17.6 to 18, I get \(
\frac{3.3 \times 18}{0.224}
\). If I multiply 3.3 and 18, I get 59.4. And then if I divide that by 0.224, I get 265.18. 

Based on these estimates, it looks like the actual answer is probably somewhere between 243 and 265. But when I look at the answer choices, I think a good estimate would be around 260 or 270. I'm going to go with B. 270, but I could be off.

